{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>Keep silent.</b> As if it said: keep silent and listen to me:" "<b>and let the nations renew [their] strength.</b> If they have ability:" "<b>Let them approach.</b> And after they renew strength, then let them speak, and let us draw near for judgment, to know which is mighty:"], :book :isaiah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 41, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Isaiah, by M. Friedlander; Society of Hebrew Literature, London 1877" "https://www.nli.org.il/he/books/NNL_ALEPH001338443"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:57:15.692396709Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}